<title>RUSSIA: Russia RTS shares index edges down to 355.30 close.</title>
<headline>Russia RTS shares index edges down to 355.30 close.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Russian Trading System 22-share index closed slightly off on Tuesday at 355.30 after 356.52 on Monday, the NAUFOR brokers association said.</p>
<p>Total market reported turnover was $31.7 million, below the $40 million generally considered healthy.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
